<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43530" root="&#xA;                        محو&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He effaced, erased, rased, obliterated,</i>
or <i>cancelled, it; removed,</i> or <i>did away with, its
impression</i> or <i>trace.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَتِ الرِّيحُ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ الأَسْقَامَ وَالدُّنُوبَ</span>
                        <i>The wind made to pass away,</i> or <i>dispelled, the clouds.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَا الصُّبْحُ اللَّيْلَ</span>
                        <i>Daybreak dispelled the night.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاٱللّٰهُ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ الأَسْقَامَ وَالدُّنُوبَ</span> [<i>God removed from him
diseases and sins;</i> as though He cancelled them].
(Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عفو</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِحْسَانُ يَمْحُو الإِسَآءَةَ</span>
                        <i>Beneficence effaces, obliterates,</i> or <i>cancels, evil
conduct.</i> (TA)

